            "markup": "\u003Cp\u003EWelcome to your monthly dose of #umbraCoffee\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B\u200B! Your hosts - Marcin and Callum - together with their guest(s) will drive through all of the community news and happenings in the Umbraco world. So... grab a cuppa, join us LIVE and enjoy!\n\nToday we\u0026#39;re joined by Matt Brailsford - AI Staff Engineer @ Umbraco HQ, Co-founder of CODECABIN and Creator of UMB.FYI.\n\nSee ya?!\n\n---\n\u2615 Wanna buy us a coffee/pizza/donuts?\nhttps://www.buymeacoffee.com/umbracoffee\n---\n\nNotes:\n//ToDo\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Ca href=\u0022https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=uY9pZz5NHaQ\u0022 target=\u0022_blank\u0022 rel=\u0022noopener\u0022\u003ERead the original article\u003C/a\u003E\u003C/p\u003E"
          }
        }
      ]
